    "date": "September 04, 2023",
    "role": "Editor",
    "description": "Rescore 1 track: This Is The End - Markus · John Paesano\nRescore 2 track: Finale · John Paesano · Pete Anthony · American Federation of Musicians\nOriginal track: Above the Law Opening Titles · Jared Emerson-Johnson\n\nWith Rescore 1 I wanted to enhance that feeling of reminiscence the characters feel when they grab their belongings throughout the house, taking only what they need and leaving their valued items and their past behind. With Rescore 2 I wanted to amp the mood up a bit, and give it a feel of \"gearing up\" and \"preparing for what's to come,\" which is kind of what the original had, while still leaving a bit of reflection as each character leaves their home.. I just now realized that both of these tracks are composed by John Paesano.\n\n0:00 Timestamps\n0:05 Rescore 1\n2:22 Rescore 2",
